      "content": "hey my tooth is freaking killing me and i cant sleep at all. i have some tylenol here but the usual dose isnt doing anything. if i took like 4 or 5 of the extra strength ones at once would that actually help me get through the night or is that too much?? i just need the pain to stop.",
