      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know the 4000 limit but that's for a whole day right? i'm just saying i'm in so much pain i don't think i can wait until morning to see a dentist or anything. if i just took a bigger dose right now to get through the next 6 hours, is it really that dangerous? it's not like i'm trying to overdose or anything i just need to sleep. maybe i can just take a few more and then not take any for the rest of the day?",
